                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Harlow, deputy
                        marshal, to Mr. Gregory, marshal.</hi>
                </head>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1869-08-19"><hi rendition="#italic">August</hi>
                        19, 1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">E. M. Gregory</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">United States Marshal</hi>, 1438 <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >North Thirteenth street:</hi></p>
                <p>DuBose and McNulty were arrested June 23 for a violation of neutrality laws, and,
                    after remaining in jail some time, were discharged on their own
                    recognizance.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>S. H. HARLOW,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Deputy Marshal.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
